{"4087940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veyora", "steam_appid": 4087940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the World of Veyora</strong><br><br><br>Veyora is a medieval open-world RPG with elements of farming, survival, and adventure. In a vast, stylized world, you decide where to live and what to create – whether near a bustling town, in the lonely mountains, or by a peaceful lake. Each location offers its own resources, challenges, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Farm, and Live Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Veyora, there is no set path. You decide what to make of your life – focus on peaceful farming, prepare for battles against dark creatures, or combine both. Build freely whatever you wish: a simple home, a sprawling farm, or a fortified base. Cultivate crops, raise animals, gather resources, and craft everything you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the world’s peaceful surface lie hidden dangers. Bandits and mystical creatures roam the forests, while deep dungeons conceal treasures, puzzles, and ancient secrets. Those who dare to face the darkness will find both risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together or Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Veyora on your own or together with up to four friends in cooperative mode. With loyal NPC companions by your side or as part of a group, you can explore the world, build together, trade, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veyora is an open world you shape yourself – full of freedom, choices, and stories that only you can write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/1a9539024f22e634163aad1a5405c8cd.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/1a9539024f22e634163aad1a5405c8cd.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/1a9539024f22e634163aad1a5405c8cd.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Freely:</strong> Choose your own building spot and create whatever you want – from a small farm to a large base.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming &amp; Crafting:</strong> Grow crops, raise animals, and craft tools, weapons, and equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World:</strong> Discover villages, forests, ruins, and hidden places filled with resources and stories.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons &amp; Enemies:</strong> Battle bandits, monsters, and dark creatures, or explore ancient dungeons for valuable rewards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Companions &amp; Co-op Mode:</strong> Play solo, with AI companions, or online with up to four friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> Whether peaceful farmer, curious explorer, or seasoned warrior – in Veyora, you decide who you want to be.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Creation:</strong> Design your own character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Food, energy, and weather shape your daily life – balance is vital for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talents &amp; Spells:</strong> Advance through a deep talent system, learn new abilities, and discover ancient magic to strengthen yourself in battle or everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s your story?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the World of Veyora</strong><br><br><br>Veyora is a medieval open-world RPG with elements of farming, survival, and adventure. In a vast, stylized world, you decide where to live and what to create – whether near a bustling town, in the lonely mountains, or by a peaceful lake. Each location offers its own resources, challenges, and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/b4314baa41a313c88389e963cf5e9c22.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Farm, and Live Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Veyora, there is no set path. You decide what to make of your life – focus on peaceful farming, prepare for battles against dark creatures, or combine both. Build freely whatever you wish: a simple home, a sprawling farm, or a fortified base. Cultivate crops, raise animals, gather resources, and craft everything you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/3eb25ff3cd6c6d121a44964d4840c286.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Darkness and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the world’s peaceful surface lie hidden dangers. Bandits and mystical creatures roam the forests, while deep dungeons conceal treasures, puzzles, and ancient secrets. Those who dare to face the darkness will find both risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.poster.avif?t=1788097961\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.webm?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/extras/981a4406e6c2e2635d266be149b426fb.mp4?t=1788097961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together or Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Veyora on your own or together with up to four friends in cooperative mode. With loyal NPC companions by your side or as part of a group, you can explore the world, build together, trade, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Veyora is an open world you shape yourself – full of freedom, choices, and stories that only you can write.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam