nce through a deep talent system, learn new abilities, and discover ancient magic to strengthen yourself in battle or everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s your story?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Veyora is a medieval open-world RPG with survival and farming elements made from a solo developer. Choose your spot, build a farm, home or base, explore the world and play solo or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/554fdcdd2f6694471319faa4e0883deaae04ca6c/header.jpg?t=1788097961", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/831acd4fe5d16da13f2123c4a98c65163b685f9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788097961", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087940/831acd4fe5d16da13f2123c4a98c65163b685f9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788097961", "website": "https://gaming.jeps.ch", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K oder AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / GTX 1050 Ti oder AMD Radeon RX 560 (2–4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8000 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super 